    <string name="about_title">About Bêje</string>
    <string name="about_message">Version %1$s\n\nBêje turns your speech into text entirely on your device. Audio is never stored and no data is sent over the internet. The internet is only used to download language packs from Google Play.\n\nOpen-source components: Vosk and Kaldi models (Apache 2.0), JNA (Apache 2.0), AndroidX and Material Components (Apache 2.0).</string>
